              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Moses, “Cut two tables of stone like the first; and I will write upon the tables the words that were on the first tables, which you broke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Be ready in the morning, and come up in the morning to Mount Sinai, and present yourself there to me on the top of the mountain. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No man shall come up with you, and let no man be seen throughout all the mountain; let no flocks or herds feed before that mountain.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Moses cut two tables of stone like the first; and he rose early in the morning and went up on Mount Sinai, as the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had commanded him, and took in his hand two tables of stone. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " descended in the cloud and stood with him there, and proclaimed the name of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
