          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he said, “Behold, I make a covenant. Before all your people I will do marvels, such as have not been wrought in all the earth or in any nation; and all the people among whom you are shall see the work of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; for it is a terrible thing that I will do with you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
