        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Observe what I command you this day. Behold, I will drive out before you the Amorites, the Canaanites, the Hittites, the Perizzites, the Hivites, and the Jebusites. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Take heed to yourself, lest you make a covenant with the inhabitants of the land whither you go, lest it become a snare in the midst of you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You shall tear down their altars, and break their pillars, and cut down their Asherim ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
